edge?"'::jsonb, '"A student is preparing an evidence-based presentation on ancient technology and wants to avoid claiming that every practice was universal. Which approach is academically strongest?"'::jsonb, '"Which order places the four Ashramas in their conventional life-stage sequence?"'::jsonb, '"A student wants to study how metalworking and textile dyeing represent different technical practices. Which unit contains both?"'::jsonb, '"A student is explaining Purusharthas to a class. Which example best distinguishes Kama from Artha?"'::jsonb, '"A student has to map six Vedangas to their fields. Which mapping is wholly correct?"'::jsonb, '"An assignment considers both measurement units and the number system as related topics. Which unit is appropriate?"'::jsonb, '"A student mixes up Nirukta and Vyakarana. Which distinction corrects the notes?"'::jsonb, '"Which set contains only the four Vedas?"'::jsonb, '"A reading assignment asks students to distinguish Puranas from Itihasa as sources of knowledge. Which comparison best matches the syllabus?"'::jsonb, '"A lesson distinguishes town planning from temple architecture. Which broader tradition in the syllabus connects them?"'::jsonb, '"An assignment asks which goal of life concerns liberation rather than material prosperity. Which contrast is correct?"'::jsonb, '"A text analysis task examines Sanskrit grammar as potentially useful in natural language processing. What makes it relevant to the course?"'::jsonb, '"A student is asked to explain how a text handles ethical living, duty and liberation. Which framework is most relevant?"'::jsonb, '"A lesson compares how language sounds are articulated and how words are grammatically formed. Which pairing is accurate?"'::jsonb, '"A calendar project studies the astronomical basis of traditional timekeeping. Which topic should be consulted first?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Sacred ecology and environment"'::jsonb, '"Word formatting"'::jsonb, '"Number system and units"'::jsonb, '