etable is publish tomorrow."'::jsonb, '"The timetable has publish tomorrow."'::jsonb, '"The timetable will be published tomorrow."'::jsonb, '"The staff will be published the timetable."'::jsonb, '"Blame the audience"'::jsonb, '"Repeat the definition word-for-word and move on"'::jsonb, '"Give a short example or analogy and invite a clarification question"'::jsonb, '"Proceed faster"'::jsonb, '"I''d be grateful if you could approve the attached plan by Friday."'::jsonb, '"Approval or whatever is fine."'::jsonb, '"You must do it because I said so."'::jsonb, '"Send me the approval today."'::jsonb, '"The topic is complicated, so no decision is possible."'::jsonb, '"To conclude, the trial met the stated criteria; I recommend a monitored rollout and review after one month."'::jsonb, '"That is all, and I do not know what to add."'::jsonb, '"My slides are finished."'::jsonb, '"Printed notes always produce better marks."'::jsonb, '"Students may use different revision preferences."'::jsonb, '"Digital files cannot contain notes."'::jsonb, '"All students dislike digital files."'::jsonb, '"You know why I am writing."'::jsonb, '"I request leave from 14 to 16 December because of a scheduled medical appointment."'::jsonb, '"This is about something I need."'::jsonb, '"Hey, I won''t be there."'::jsonb, '"The file might be corrupted."'::jsonb, '"The upload could finish soon."'::jsonb, '"Users must log out before maintenance."'::jsonb, '"The server may restart tonight."'::jsonb, '"Present continuous only"'::jsonb, '"Future perfect only"'::jsonb, '"Simple past"'::jsonb, '"Simple future"'::jsonb, '"Ask the audience to leave"'::jsonb, '"Briefly restate the two parts, answer each in turn, and check if anything remains"'::jsonb, '"Change to an unrelated slide"'::jsonb, '"Answer only the easiest part"'::jsonb, '"Write only unfamiliar words"'::jsonb, '"Record the main claim and its most relevant supporting points"'::jsonb, '"Record page numbers but no ideas"'::jsonb, '"Copy every sentence without selection"'::jsonb, '"have"'::jsonb, '"is"'::jsonb, '"are"'::jsonb, '"were"'::jsonb, '"have"'::jsonb, '"were"'::jsonb, '"are"'::jsonb, '"is"'::jsonb, '"Keep every term unexplained"'::jsonb, '"Remove all examples"'::jsonb, '"Increase speaking speed"'::jsonb, '"Define essential terms briefly and use examples at the audience''s level"'::jsonb, '"would to"'::jsonb, '"can to"'::jsonb, '"might not have"'::jsonb, '"ought to"'::jsonb, '"Identify the claim and compare each example with it"'::jsonb, '"Assume every example proves the claim"'::jsonb, '"Count the number of paragraphs only"'::jsonb, '"Copy the title without reading"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

