, '"Environmental protection is not mentioned in Article 51A"'::jsonb, '"Fundamental Duties automatically override every right"'::jsonb, '"Article 51A applies only to municipal officers"'::jsonb, '"The duty is relevant, but a restriction on speech must still be assessed under the constitutional provisions governing that freedom"'::jsonb, '"Article 40"'::jsonb, '"Article 19"'::jsonb, '"Article 21"'::jsonb, '"Article 14"'::jsonb, '"Part IVA"'::jsonb, '"Part II"'::jsonb, '"Part IV"'::jsonb, '"Part III"'::jsonb, '"Declare every speech restriction invalid without examining the provision"'::jsonb, '"Identify the relevant Article 19 freedom and test whether the restriction is reasonable and falls within a constitutionally permitted ground"'::jsonb, '"Decide solely by the location of the person''s district"'::jsonb, '"Treat the restriction as a Fundamental Duty"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

